// Which tests cover which file, derived from real imports rather than guessed
// (checked 2026-10-14 by resolving every test file's import list).
//
// An empty lane list is a DECLARATION, not a dodge, and each one has a reason:
//
//   App.tsx, ErrorBoundary.tsx, Inventory.tsx, SubmitPart.tsx, TrackCanvas.tsx,
//   VerdictLine.tsx   React components. vitest runs in node with no DOM, and
//                     vitest.config.ts's docblock forbids widening that as a
//                     substitute for a real testing-library setup (task E11).
//                     VerdictLine gets a renderToStaticMarkup harness in X2b;
//                     the rest wait for E11.
//   (verdictView.ts is no longer here: task T3a landed on 2026-10-14 and the
//   lane now names app/src/verdictView.test.ts, 23 cases over both precedences.)
//   main.tsx          The root mount. Three lines, nothing to assert.
//   env.d.ts          Ambient type declarations.
//   vite/vitest config, package.json, bun.lock, docs, css, html
//                     Not code under test.
//   .github/workflows/ci.yml
//                     The workflow IS the test runner, so it has no unit lane.
//                     It was verified the only way that means anything: two
//                     deliberate breaks pushed to a throwaway branch on
//                     2026-10-14. PLANK_WIDTH_MM 40 -> 41 went red at
//                     analytic.test.ts:341. CYCLE_RANK_CEILING 20 -> 3 went
//                     GREEN, which is how eng finding E13 got its value-pin
//                     half.
